# Files the public Windows 1.10.4.2 ZIP must yield, read by unpack.py.
# Columns: mode, path in the ready directory. The ZIP was made with MS-DOS
# file attributes and carries no Unix modes. Wine does not need an
# executable bit; MegaMaker.exe gets one so the tree reads like an install.
# korrid verifies the whole ZIP against its pinned SHA-256 before
# unpacking, so this list holds no hashes.
0644 data.win
0755 MegaMaker.exe
